    "Name": "Anubis",
    "Details": "Designed by Fredonian Industrial Technologies, the Anubis was originally designed to compliment the Osiris BattleMech in use by the Federated Suns. This particular Anubis was fully customized by an unknown Mechwarrior for the Solaris arenas. All the weapons and electronics have been overhauled to feature dual Improved ATM-6 systems and a pair of ER Medium Pulse Lasers. \n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Nimble</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.05</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
